{"unit_id":"253071608__dsh-localnote#card-zh","repo":"253071608/dsh-localnote","commit":"b1ababa535d80de0368e9036760e31de7eb569f4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-localnote 是 DSH 网页端的灵感与待办浮窗，适合希望随手保存想法并在合适时间继续处理的用户。它在 shell.overlay 中注册面板，并由主机端提供 REST 接口和本地持久化。你可以创建、编辑、完成或删除笔记，在详情中补充文字并粘贴截图，也可以设置到期时间。到期后可选择仅提醒，或调用所选/默认模型创建一次性 agent 整理内容并回写结果。列表展示统计、倒计时和执行状态；数据保存在用户家目录，无需额外配置项。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:784","index.js:261-329","index.js:390-518"]}
{"unit_id":"253071608__dsh-localnote#card-en","repo":"253071608/dsh-localnote","commit":"b1ababa535d80de0368e9036760e31de7eb569f4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-localnote adds an idea and todo panel to the DSH web client. Users can save notes, paste screenshots, and set due times. Each due note can trigger a reminder or a one-off AI agent using a selected or default model; its result appears in the note. Data is stored under the user home directory.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:784","index.js:261-329","index.js:390-518"]}
